WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.769 --> 00:00:13.940
"It snowed last night!" Harry said.

2
00:00:13.941 --> 00:00:16.464
"Can we go sledding?"

3
00:00:16.465 --> 00:00:23.066
Mom nodded. "Let's go to the big hill."

4
00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:25.888
Emmy found her scarf.

5
00:00:25.889 --> 00:00:29.260
Oliver put on snow pants.

6
00:00:29.261 --> 00:00:32.679
Harry tied his snow boots.

7
00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:36.264
Dad put the sleds in the car.

8
00:00:36.265 --> 00:00:39.782
"Let's go," he said.

9
00:00:39.783 --> 00:00:44.341
The family drove to the tall hill.

10
00:00:44.342 --> 00:00:47.666
The parking lot was at the bottom.

11
00:00:47.667 --> 00:00:52.680
"This will be fun," Mom said.

12
00:00:52.681 --> 00:00:58.369
"The hill is really tall!" Oliver said.

13
00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:02.123
Harry groaned.

14
00:01:02.124 --> 00:01:05.013
"We have to walk up that hill!"

15
00:01:05.014 --> 00:01:09.638
"It's really steep!" Emmy said.

16
00:01:09.639 --> 00:01:12.911
Dad checked a map on his phone.

17
00:01:12.912 --> 00:01:16.575
"There's a parking lot at the top," he said.

18
00:01:16.576 --> 00:01:19.331
"Let's park there."

19
00:01:19.332 --> 00:01:22.782
Everyone got back in the car.

20
00:01:22.783 --> 00:01:27.155
They drove up to the other parking lot.

21
00:01:27.156 --> 00:01:30.616
"This is better," Harry said.

22
00:01:30.617 --> 00:01:36.390
Emmy shot down the hill. "Whee!"

23
00:01:36.391 --> 00:01:40.220
She crashed into a snowbank.

24
00:01:40.221 --> 00:01:45.966
Boom! Harry crashed into Emmy.

25
00:01:45.967 --> 00:01:51.204
Oliver hit a bump and flew off his sled.

26
00:01:51.205 --> 00:01:56.362
Finally Mom and Dad zoomed down.

27
00:01:56.363 --> 00:02:04.018
Everyone lay in the snow and laughed.

28
00:02:04.019 --> 00:02:08.978
"I love sledding," Oliver said.

29
00:02:08.979 --> 00:02:13.113
"Let's do it again!" Mom said.

30
00:02:13.114 --> 00:02:15.456
Everyone got up.

31
00:02:15.457 --> 00:02:19.917
Harry looked at the hill and groaned.

32
00:02:19.918 --> 00:02:27.153
"Ugh. We have to walk back up!"
